  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Districts of Excellence&#x201d; project in three district</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  programme aims  to improve learning outcomes through strengthening the education management at district and school levels in three of the poorest performing districts in Sierra Leone &#x2013; Port Loko, Falaba, and Pujehun - so that children are in school (for at least 6 hours per day, every day of term); safe (positive behaviour management and robust child protection protocols); and learning (in every class, during every lesson, acquiring relevant knowledge, skills and attitudes).</narrative>
  </description>
